        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_income = 875\n    depreciation = 400\n    increase_accounts_receivable = 800 - 750\n    increase_inventories = 850 - 720\n    increase_accounts_payable = 400 - 300\n    increase_accrued_expenses = 120 - 90\n    capital_expenditures = 5000 - 4250\n    net_debt_issued = (550 - 500) + (1500 - 1400)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    cash_from_operations = (\n        net_income\n        + depreciation\n        - increase_accounts_receivable\n        - increase_inventories\n        + increase_accounts_payable\n        + increase_accrued_expenses\n    )\n    answer = cash_from_operations - capital_expenditures + net_debt_issued\n\n    # Return answer rounded to one decimal place\n    return round(answer, 1)\n```",
